---
import Section from '../../layout/Section.astro';
---

<Section contained={false} spacing="none" class="py-24">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6">
            <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl text-center">
                <h2 class="font-manrope text-4xl font-normal leading-tight text-white lg:text-5xl" data-translate="operations.title" data-title-break-after-words="en:4,pt:5,es:4">
                    Global Payroll Operations —<br>Under Your Full Control
                </h2>
                <div class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-3xl space-y-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-400">
                    <p data-translate="operations.intro1">With growth comes operational complexity. Before you know it, you have more employees, more contractors, more global payments coming all at once</p>
                    <p data-translate="operations.intro2">Garna gives growing companies a solid foundation for their payroll infrastructure. It's built as a centralized system that keeps everything simple while still giving you visibility and control</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="mt-12 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
                <article class="min-w-[320px] rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0b0b0b] p-5 md:min-w-0">
                    <div class="flex h-40 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-[#0b0b0b]">
                        <div class="w-[88%] rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-[#141414] p-4 text-white">
                            <p class="min-w-0 truncate text-sm font-semibold" data-translate="operationsVisual.operationsHub">Operations hub</p>
                            <div class="mt-4 space-y-3">
                                <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 text-xs"><span class="min-w-0 truncate" data-translate="operationsVisual.employeePayroll">Employee payroll</span><span class="shrink-0 font-semibold text-[#5EA500]" data-translate="operationsVisual.live">Live</span></div>
                                <div class="h-2 rounded-full bg-white/10"><div class="mid-size-progress-a h-2 w-full rounded-full bg-[#5EA500]"></div></div>
                                <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 text-xs"><span class="min-w-0 truncate" data-translate="operationsVisual.contractorPayments">Contractor payments</span><span class="shrink-0 font-semibold text-[#5EA500]" data-translate="operationsVisual.synced">Synced</span></div>
                                <div class="h-2 rounded-full bg-white/10"><div class="mid-size-progress-b h-2 w-full rounded-full bg-[#5EA500]"></div></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-semibold text-white" data-translate="operations.system.title">One system to rule them all</h3>
                    <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-400" data-translate="operations.system.description">Garna brings together every document and tool to one platform that scales with your team. Employee payroll, contractor payments, onboarding, approvals and reporting are at hand whenever you need them</p>
                </article>

                <article class="min-w-[320px] rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0b0b0b] p-5 md:min-w-0">
                    <div class="flex h-40 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-[#0b0b0b]">
                        <div class="w-[82%] rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-[#141414] p-4 text-white">
                            <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
                                <div class="min-w-0">
                                    <p class="min-w-0 truncate text-sm font-semibold" data-translate="operationsVisual.payrollSpend">Payroll spend</p>
                                    <p class="text-xs text-gray-500" data-translate="operationsVisual.thisMonth">This month</p>
                                </div>
                                <span class="mid-size-visual-pulse shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#5EA500]/15 px-2 py-1 text-[10px] font-semibold text-[#5EA500] xl:px-3 xl:text-xs" data-translate="operationsVisual.realTime">Real time</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="mt-5 grid grid-cols-3 gap-3 text-xs">
                                <div><p class="min-w-0 truncate text-gray-500" data-translate="operationsVisual.teams">Teams</p><p class="font-semibold">$82k</p></div>
                                <div><p class="min-w-0 truncate text-gray-500" data-translate="operationsVisual.countries">Countries</p><p class="font-semibold">14</p></div>
                                <div><p class="text-gray-500">FX</p><p class="font-semibold">6</p></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-semibold text-white" data-translate="operations.visibility.title">Total visibility for payroll costs</h3>
                    <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-400" data-translate="operations.visibility.description">Within the platform, you can see how payroll spend goes across departments, countries, contractors, and teams in real time</p>
                </article>

                <article class="min-w-[320px] rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0b0b0b] p-5 md:min-w-0">
                    <div class="flex h-40 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-[#0b0b0b]">
                        <div class="w-full max-w-[14rem] space-y-1.5">
                            <div class="mid-size-row-step flex items-center justify-between gap-3 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-[#141414] px-4 py-2.5 text-white">
                                <span class="min-w-0 truncate text-sm font-semibold" data-translate="operationsVisual.invoices">Invoices</span>
                                <span class="flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#5EA500]/15 text-xs text-[#5EA500]">✓</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="mid-size-row-step flex items-center justify-between gap-3 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-[#191919] px-4 py-2.5 text-white" style="animation-delay: 0.28s;">
                                <span class="min-w-0 truncate text-sm font-semibold" data-translate="operationsVisual.taxWorkflows">Tax workflows</span>
                                <span class="flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#5EA500]/15 text-xs text-[#5EA500]">✓</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="mid-size-row-step flex items-center justify-between gap-3 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-[#191919] px-4 py-2.5 text-white" style="animation-delay: 0.56s;">
                                <span class="min-w-0 truncate text-sm font-semibold" data-translate="operationsVisual.approvals">Approvals</span>
                                <span class="flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#5EA500]/15 text-xs text-[#5EA500]">✓</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-semibold text-white" data-translate="operations.automation.title">Automation that saves from operational load</h3>
                    <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-400" data-translate="operations.automation.description">Payroll calculations, invoices, tax workflows, recurring payouts and approvals are automated, so your team spends less time on administrative tasks and more on earning</p>
                </article>

                <article class="min-w-[320px] rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0b0b0b] p-5 md:min-w-0">
                    <div class="flex h-40 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-[#0b0b0b]">
                        <div class="w-[82%] rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-[#141414] p-4 text-white">
                            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-xs">
                                <div class="mid-size-chip-step min-w-0 truncate rounded-lg bg-white/5 px-2 py-2 text-center" data-translate="operationsVisual.local">Local</div>
                                <div class="mid-size-chip-step min-w-0 truncate rounded-lg bg-white/5 px-2 py-2 text-center" style="animation-delay: 0.18s;" data-translate="operationsVisual.hybrid">Hybrid</div>
                                <div class="mid-size-chip-step min-w-0 truncate rounded-lg bg-white/5 px-2 py-2 text-center text-[11px]" style="animation-delay: 0.36s;" data-translate="operationsVisual.international">International</div>
                                <div class="mid-size-chip-step min-w-0 truncate rounded-lg bg-[#5EA500]/15 px-2 py-2 text-center text-[#5EA500]" style="animation-delay: 0.54s;" data-translate="operationsVisual.remote">Remote</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-semibold text-white" data-translate="operations.teams.title">Built for teams all around the world</h3>
                    <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-400" data-translate="operations.teams.description">Your workforce might combine different formats — local, hybrid, international, completely remote. With Garna, your payroll operations go across different locations and payment structures</p>
                </article>

                <article class="min-w-[320px] rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0b0b0b] p-5 md:min-w-0">
                    <div class="flex h-40 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-[#0b0b0b]">
                        <div class="w-[88%] rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-[#141414] p-4 text-white">
                            <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
                                <p class="min-w-0 truncate text-sm font-semibold" data-translate="operationsVisual.growthControls">Growth controls</p>
                                <span class="rounded-full bg-[#5EA500]/15 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-[#5EA500]">API</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_auto] gap-3">
                                <div class="grid h-14 grid-cols-5 items-end gap-1.5">
                                    <span class="mid-size-bar h-4 w-full rounded bg-[#5EA500]/25"></span>
                                    <span class="mid-size-bar h-6 w-full rounded bg-[#5EA500]/35" style="animation-delay: 0.12s;"></span>
                                    <span class="mid-size-bar h-8 w-full rounded bg-[#5EA500]/50" style="animation-delay: 0.24s;"></span>
                                    <span class="mid-size-bar h-10 w-full rounded bg-[#5EA500]/65" style="animation-delay: 0.36s;"></span>
                                    <span class="mid-size-bar h-12 w-full rounded bg-[#7ED321]" style="animation-delay: 0.48s;"></span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="space-y-1.5 text-[10px] text-gray-400">
                                    <div class="min-w-0 truncate rounded-lg bg-white/5 px-2 py-1" data-translate="operationsVisual.teams">Teams</div>
                                    <div class="min-w-0 truncate rounded-lg bg-white/5 px-2 py-1" data-translate="operationsVisual.markets">Markets</div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-semibold text-white" data-translate="operations.flexibility.title">Flexibility attuned to your growth</h3>
                    <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-400" data-translate="operations.flexibility.description">When a payroll system is truly yours, it scales with you and with API integrations, flexible payment infrastructure and workflows that expand as you grow</p>
                </article>

                <article class="min-w-[320px] rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0b0b0b] p-5 md:min-w-0">
                    <div class="flex h-40 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-[#0b0b0b]">
                        <div class="w-[82%] rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-[#141414] p-4 text-white">
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                                <div class="mid-size-check-glow flex h-12 w-12 min-h-12 min-w-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#5EA500]/15 text-xl text-[#5EA500]">✓</div>
                                <div class="min-w-0">
                                    <p class="min-w-0 truncate text-sm font-semibold" data-translate="operationsVisual.complianceCheck">Compliance check</p>
                                    <p class="min-w-0 truncate text-xs text-gray-500" data-translate="operationsVisual.controlsEnabled">Payroll controls enabled</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="mt-4 min-w-0 truncate rounded-lg bg-[#5EA500]/10 px-3 py-2 text-xs text-[#5EA500]" data-translate="operationsVisual.reportingReady">Reporting workflow ready</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-semibold text-white" data-translate="operations.compliance.title">No more manual oversight of compliance</h3>
                    <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-400" data-translate="operations.compliance.description">To avoid possible compliance issues, the system uses built-in operational controls, automated payroll tax handling, and reporting workflows</p>
                </article>
            </div>
        </div>
    </Section>
